{
  "$id": "risk-eval.json",
  "$comment": "Mode risk-eval: Risk.Eval.runCaseReported, the test-only differential harness of docs/spec/risk.md 8.3 (ve_risk_eval). Its rows carry no id; the binding is the case digest.",
